; gamemd.exe 1.001 only (Syringe path). game.exe is handled by the inline
; patch when loaded through dsound.dll.
;
; TypeSelect (T, whole map) and CombatantSelect (Q) loop over every matching
; unit and call TechnoClass::Select without clearing AllowVoice (0x822CF2),
; so every unit shouts VoiceSelect at once. Team select and band-box clear it
; after the first unit. SelectOne replaces the "call [vt+14C]" in the loop,
; makes the call itself, then clears AllowVoice; LoopDone re-arms it.
732B3D = TypeSelect_SelectOne, A
732B4C = TypeSelect_LoopDone, 5
7324A0 = CombatantSelect_SelectOne, A
7324AF = CombatantSelect_LoopDone, 5
;
; Healers (negative CombatDamage) skip ClickedAction when the group attacks,
; or when their own action on the target is None/Move/NoMove/0x3B. They get
; Area Guard on an armed unit from the selection instead, spread evenly across
; the line of the army, so a Repair IFV escorts rather than driving at the enemy.
; 4AE844 is the object click loop, 4AE927 the ground click loop.
4AE844 = HealerEscort_ClickedAction, 6
4AE927 = HealerEscort_CellClickedAction, 6
